@startuml
title SSD - UC-12 - Manage Blocking Rules (Phase 2)

autonumber
actor Learner
participant "FocusDesktop System" as System

Learner -> System : requestBlockingRules()
System --> Learner : blockingRules(items)

Learner -> System : createBlockingRule(pattern, action, category)
System --> Learner : blockingRuleCreated(rule)

Learner -> System : deleteBlockingRule(ruleId)
System --> Learner : blockingRuleDeleted(ruleId)

note right of System
  Rules are evaluated only while a focus session is
  RUNNING. Monitoring is suspended during breaks.
end note

@enduml
